},
{
"id": 10339,
"en": "The Truth",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_menu_title|TITTLE + tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|NAME"
},
{
"id": 10340,
"en": "Principles",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_menu_title|TITTLE + tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|NAME"
},
{
"id": 10341,
"en": "Free Entry",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_menu_title|TITTLE + tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|NAME"
},
{
"id": 10342,
"en": "Gotta follow the river to avoid gettin' lost. Have to hurry before the cold gets me.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10343,
"en": "There's a bear nearby. Gotta follow the river and find Baba-chan.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10344,
"en": "Baba-chan could be in trouble. Better hurry.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10345,
"en": "Gotta get a rabbit to nurse Baba back to health.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10346,
"en": "Okudera-han's supposed to be close. Guess I should go deeper.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10347,
"en": "Okudera-han says it's important. Gotta crouch and make sure I ain't seen.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10348,
"en": "Gotta reload to use the gun. Let's give it a go.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10349,
"en": "Gotta nail the boulder across the stream.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10350,
"en": "Off to find that huntin' hut. I should check the map to avoid gettin' lost.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10351,
"en": "Look for deer tracks, huh? Should be some right around here.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10352,
"en": "Gotta follow the deer tracks. They'll lead me to my prey.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10353,
"en": "I'll crouch down to sneak up on deer. Gotta hunt to survive on the mountain, right?",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10354,
"en": "Time to collect the deer I shot. Can't waste the life they gave up for me.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10355,
"en": "Back to the village. Gotta repay Nishina-han's wife for the favor.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10356,
"en": "After returning the favor, I'll head over to Okudera-han and learn to trap.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10357,
"en": "Gotta go up along the river and look for trap sites.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10358,
"en": "Set a trap at that trap site there, huh? Sounds easy enough.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10359,
"en": "There should be other trap sites here. I should find 'em with a quick look around.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10360,
"en": "There should be one more trap site here. Gotta find it somehow.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10361,
"en": "I set traps at the trap sites around here. Guess I'll go check if anything's been caught yet.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10362,
"en": "Yama-oroshi! Here!? I gotta chase it away from the village!",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10363,
"en": "Two choices. Leave for Tsukimino now, or stay here to hunt a while longer.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10364,
"en": "Nishina-han and another guy haven't come back from the mountain yet...",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10365,
"en": "Nishina-han hasn't returned from the mountain. I should check on his wife.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10366,
"en": "Nishina-han's wife is worried. Gotta tell Okudera-han and, then go find these people.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10367,
"en": "Gotta find some sort of a clue. Guess I'll just hike around till I find one.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10368,
"en": "These footprints should lead me to Nishina-han or the lost guy.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10369,
"en": "This guy's gonna need food.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10370,
"en": "The mountain's a rough place. I gotta be tougher to survive.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10371,
"en": "There's a stranger at the village entrance. Sakurai-han seemed concerned, too.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10372,
"en": "Narumi's after Yama-oroshi as well. Better let Okudera-han know.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10373,
"en": "That blast had to be Narumi's doin'. Gotta go deeper and find him.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10374,
"en": "Narumi's gotta be close. Let's follow the footprints from the blast site.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10375,
"en": "That Narumi better not cause any trouble. Not gonna lie, I'm worried.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10376,
"en": "Okudera-han's sick. Gotta check on him...",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10377,
"en": "I gotta get bear bile for Okudera-han. Need to get ready and tell Sakurai-han before I head out.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10378,
"en": "First, I gotta find some bear tracks. Gotta make sure the cold doesn't do me in, too.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10379,
"en": "Follow the bear tracks, and I'll find a bear. Can't lose sight of these tracks.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10380,
"en": "Bears could be in the area. Gotta be careful.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10381,
"en": "This area seems to be the bear's territory. I'll find it and get the bile I need.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10382,
"en": "Managed to take that bear down. Just need the bile, and to give thanks for it.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10383,
"en": "Okudera-han's condition's settled, but what'll I do from here?",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10384,
"en": "Narumi scattered bear bait across the mountain. Gotta tell Sakurai-han when I can go get them.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10385,
"en": "There's supposed to be around eight pieces of bear bait scattered around. Gotta go on foot and find 'em.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10386,
"en": "Found one. Seven left. Got a long ways to go.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10387,
"en": "That's the second one. Six more bear bait pieces to go.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10388,
"en": "That's the third. Where are the other five pieces?",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10389,
"en": "Four found. Halfway there.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10390,
"en": "Finally. That's five. Three more to go.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10391,
"en": "That's six recovered, two more to go. Not much left.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10392,
"en": "That's seven . Just one left to find. Gotta keep at it.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10393,
"en": "Got all the bear bait, but that gunfire's worryin'. Better check it out.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10394,
"en": "Narumi might be where he was before. Let's track his footprints.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10395,
"en": "I can't kill Yama-oroshi now. Gotta beat it down off the mountain!",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10396,
"en": "Made it off the mountain, but just barely. Did Narumi make it down safe?",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10397,
"en": "Narumi's not back from the mountain. Gotta tell Sakurai-han and rescue Narumi.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10398,
"en": "Gotta head to where Yama-oroshi appeared. Should be some clues there.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10399,
"en": "Narumi might still be alive. Gotta follow this blood trail.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10400,
"en": "That's a lot of blood. Gotta hurry. Narumi might be bleedin' out.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10401,
"en": "Gotta get Narumi to the village. Despite all he's done, I ain't lettin' him die.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10402,
"en": "Not far to the village now. Gotta get there before Narumi drops dead.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10403,
"en": "Narumi went off to a hospital in town. Okudera-han's condition is worryin' me, though.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10404,
"en": "Okudera-han's better. What a relief. Gotta get ready to shoot Yama-oroshi with a transmitter shot.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10405,
"en": "Gotta find Yama-oroshi with nothin' to go on. Maybe I'll head to mid-mountain as a start.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10406,
"en": "Shootin' the back or legs is no good. Gotta plug it right in the belly. I'll take the shot when it stands!",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10407,
"en": "Got the transmitter planted. Mission accomplished. Back to the village.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10408,
"en": "We know where Yama-oroshi is. Gotta get ready to go up with Okudera-han.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10409,
"en": "Yama-oroshi's location is on the map. We'll use that to chase it down.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10410,
"en": "Yama-oroshi's movin' deeper into the wild. Gotta rely on this signal and chase it down.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10411,
"en": "It's going even deeper? Well, we just gotta keep chasin' it this way.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10412,
"en": "It's still goin' deeper up the mountain. Gotta be careful while chasin' the signal.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10413,
"en": "Yama-oroshi's across the canyon. Even Okudera-han can't do a thing about that.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10414,
"en": "Okudera-han went up by himself. The man's still too weak for that. I gotta help him.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10415,
"en": "Okudera-han's been up there a long while. I'll go deeper and find the man.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10416,
"en": "Nishina-han said he had somethin' to show me at his place...",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10417,
"en": "Nishina-han's in his storage shed. What's he want to show me?",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10418,
"en": "Gotta settle things with Yama-oroshi. Time to get geared up at Okudera-han's and go.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10419,
"en": "Yama-oroshi should be around here. Gotta stay alert...",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10420,
"en": "Time to settle score. This is one fight I can't lose!",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10421,
"en": "The gun's useless! Nothin' to do but slug it out!",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10422,
"en": "Gotta pick off all three, nice and neat. Concentrate.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10423,
"en": "Yama-oroshi won't come down near the village again. I should visit Okudera-han now and then.",
"ctx": "tabla yukiyama_mission_explanation|EXPLANATION"
},
{
"id": 10424,
"en": "Yuya",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10425,
"en": "Yuya here.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10426,
"en": "Sorry about the other day.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10427,
"en": "I looked all over for work",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10428,
"en": "and ended up getting a gig",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10429,
"en": "as a live-in waiter at a",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10430,
"en": "hostess club. The place is",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10431,
"en": "called La Seine. I'm going",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10432,
"en": "to try starting over in this",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10433,
"en": "town, too!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10434,
"en": "It's Ayako.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10435,
"en": "Thanks for the money,",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10436,
"en": "Haruka. Don't overdo it,",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10437,
"en": "okay? We saw you on TV",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10438,
"en": "the other day! All of us at",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10439,
"en": "Morning Glory were thrilled.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10440,
"en": "Thanks, but we're fine! ",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10441,
"en": "We're as happy as ever",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10442,
"en": "here. How about you?",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10443,
"en": "Want us to send you some",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10444,
"en": "goya?",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10445,
"en": "Ayako here.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10446,
"en": "Is that interview the",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10447,
"en": "one where you answer",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10448,
"en": "questions from readers?",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10449,
"en": "Make sure you do a",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10450,
"en": "good job!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10451,
"en": "Information Dealer",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10452,
"en": "New developments",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10453,
"en": "The name Akihiko Yamori was",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10454,
"en": "added to the blacklist by",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10455,
"en": "the Kansai credit ratings",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10456,
"en": "The past few days, it looks",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10457,
"en": "like he went to see a number",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10458,
"en": "of moneylenders in Osaka",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10459,
"en": "but got turned away by all.",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10460,
"en": "Forgot to tell you!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10461,
"en": "Kiryu-san! I forgot to tell you",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10462,
"en": "something important!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10463,
"en": "If you take a perfect shot,",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10464,
"en": "I want you to upload it to",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10465,
"en": "an image site I made!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10466,
"en": "I can't wait to see what you",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10467,
"en": "come up with!",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
"id": 10468,
"en": "I love you<Sign:1>",
"ctx": "menú/texto mail"
},
{
